1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,220
不 玛格丽特 我希望你
No, Margaret, I want you to triple check

2
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:05,860
跟合规官再三确认这事
with the compliance officer about that.

3
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:07,040
你在做什么
What are you doing?

4
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,180
我在搞个小发明
I'm working on a little something.

5
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:09,820
你知道你在做煎饼时
You know how when you're making pancakes,

6
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,380
-手上总是沾满了面糊吗 -不知道
- your hands are always full? - No.

7
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,826
这可以解决那个问题
Well, this'll solve that.

8
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:16,900
你是把烟雾报警器里的电池取下来做这个了吗
Did you take the batteries out of the smoke detector for this?

9
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,160
不 我还在 还在呢
No, no, still here. Still here.

10
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,400
不 我希望今天下午就看到投资者声明
Yeah, no, I want to read the investor statement this afternoon,

11
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,960
但是多姆 你得重新发一遍
but, Dom, you're gonna have to resend it.

12
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:26,200
你不小心把你写的小说的第一章发我了
You accidentally e-mailed me the first chapter of your novel,

13
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,920
给你点小意见
and just a tiny little note,

14
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:30,260
并非所有的胸都是丰满的
maybe not all bosoms are heaving.

15
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:31,440
谢了 各位
Thanks, guys.

16
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,220
周六早上也要打工作电话
Work call on a Saturday morning?

17
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,100
怎么回事
What's going on?

18
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:36,660
亲爱的
Honey.

19
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,240
你可能现在不想谈这个
You probably don't want to get into this right now,

20
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:41,420
但这到底是秃了一块还是发旋的中心
but is this a bald spot or the center of your swirl?

21
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:45,420
我的工作简直太惨了
My job has been miserable.

22
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:47,940
我总在工作 连睡觉的时间都没有
I'm always working, I never sleep,

23
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,320
我整天做的就是给别人擦屁股
and all I do is clean up other people's messes

24
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:52,280
因为我是所有人中唯一的成年人
because I'm the only adult in the room.

25
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:53,820
天啊
Oh, my God.

26
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:54,920
我这是又当妈了
I'm a mom again,

27
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:57,260
但我的孩子却是一帮我不爱的人
but to people I don't love.

28
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:58,940
亲爱的 听我说
Sweetheart, listen.

29
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:00,441
多年来 你一直支持着我
For years, you supported me

30
00:01:00,441 --> 00:01:03,160
任我在房地产行业耍 以及玩杂耍
while I juggled realtoring and -- and juggling.

31
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,780
现在轮到我来支持你了
And now it's my turn to support you.

32
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:07,020
有任何困难 直接找我
Anything that's not work, I'm your guy.

33
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:08,260
天啊
Oh, God!

34
00:01:20,740 --> 00:01:23,440
瞧瞧你们啊 玩得很开心嘛
Hey, look at you guys. So playful.

35
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,800
等我结婚了
When I get married,

36
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:27,435
我希望我和我老婆永远不要失去这种怪念头
I hope my wife and I never lose that sense of whimsy.

37
00:01:27,435 --> 00:01:28,900
-谢谢你 卢克 -你有什么事
- Thank you, Luke. - What do you want?

38
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:29,960
好吧 我就老实交代吧
Okay, here's the deal.

39
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:31,040
我兄弟斯库特和我
My buddy Scooter and I

40
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,815
想出了一个超赞的商业点子
came up with this really cool business idea.

41
00:01:32,815 --> 00:01:34,260
我们觉得一定会大获成功的
We think it's gonna be huge.

42
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,520
那真是太好了 小老弟
That's great, pal!

43
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,180
我们太为你骄傲了啊
We are so proud of you.

44
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:37,860
直接说弊端吧
Get to the bad part.

45
00:01:37,940 --> 00:01:38,980
没有弊端
There is no bad part.

46
00:01:39,056 --> 00:01:41,440
实际上 你们还能多赚点钱
Actually, you guys are gonna make money.

47
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,240
因为我打算退学创业 这样就省下学费了
Because I have to drop out of school to do it.

48
00:01:43,660 --> 00:01:44,900
你绝对不能退学
You're not dropping out of school.

49
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:45,556
-亲爱的 -别
- Honey... - No.

50
00:01:45,556 --> 00:01:46,802
我来处理
I -- I got this.

51
00:01:46,958 --> 00:01:48,180
不过我们应该能预料到会有这么一天
But we should've seen it coming.

52
00:01:48,180 --> 00:01:52,180
毕竟他老爹是"嘿 面糊"牌面糊挤压器的发明者
After all, his dad is the creator of the Hey Batter, Batter.

53
00:01:52,180 --> 00:01:53,560
名字只是暂用 很可能已经被人注册了
The name's a placeholder.

54
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:54,920
但非常可能还没人用
But probably still available.

55
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:57,500
爸 我希望你知道我超爱你的面糊发射器
Dad, I want you to know I love your pancake shooter.

56
00:01:57,900 --> 00:02:01,640
那你看到这个改进版的...
Have you seen the updates...to...

57
00:02:02,913 --> 00:02:04,974
即冷型吸管了吗
the Insta-Cold straw?

58
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,220
你应该作为名人被印在邮票上
You should be on a stamp.

59
00:02:06,380 --> 00:02:08,560
那东西有不电到人的时候吗
Has that ever not electrocuted someone?

60
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:10,820
有时候你必须先电击一些人
Sometimes you have to shock a few people

61
00:02:10,820 --> 00:02:12,140
才能让世界有触电般的震撼
before you shock the world.

62
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:13,920
这句话该附在你的邮票上
That should go on your stamp.

63
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:15,960
够了 别再恭维你爸了
Okay, stop flattering your dad.

64
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:17,200
你绝不能退学
You're not dropping out of school.

65
00:02:17,260 --> 00:02:18,620
你就快毕业了啊
You're almost done!

66
00:02:18,620 --> 00:02:19,270
更重要的是
And more importantly,

67
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,657
我们这个家绝不允许半途而废
we don't quit things in this family.

68
00:02:21,657 --> 00:02:23,100
海莉就从大学退学了
Haley quit college.

69
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:24,900
艾丽克斯中止了她在南极的工作
And Alex quit her job in Antarctica.

70
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,000
爸爸也从没完成过一个数独
And Dad has never finished a Sudoku.

71
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,260
那太难了
They are hard.

72
00:02:28,580 --> 00:02:29,880
妈 这不是在瞎闹
Mom, this isn't some goof.

73
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:32,120
斯库特和我真的很看好这个点子能成功
Scooter and I really believe in this idea.

74
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:33,139
至少能让我们向你们展示下
Can we at least show you

75
00:02:33,139 --> 00:02:34,840
今天下午的投资人介绍会吗
in the investor presentation this afternoon?

76
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,300
我们很乐意去听听 对吧
We'd love to hear it, wouldn't we?

77
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:37,500
当然了
Of course.

78
00:02:37,772 --> 00:02:40,052
太好了 你们一定不会失望的
Yes! You guys aren't gonna be disappointed.

79
00:02:40,052 --> 00:02:41,292
我这就去打给斯库特
I'm gonna call Scooter now.

80
00:02:43,140 --> 00:02:44,640
他绝对不能退学
He's not dropping out of school.

81
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:47,120
你必须用开放的思想去听
You have got to listen with an open mind.

82
00:02:47,180 --> 00:02:47,720
毕竟
After all,

83
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:50,020
如果所有父母都强迫自己的孩子待在学校
what kind of world would we live in if all parents forced their kids

84
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:51,620
不去追求梦想 那我们会生活在什么样的世界
to stay in school and not pursue their dreams?

85
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:54,260
没有史蒂夫·乔布斯 没有马克·扎克伯格
No Steve Jobs, no Mark Zuckerberg,

86
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,540
没有超模辛迪·克劳馥
no Cindy Crawford.

87
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:58,180
史蒂夫·乔布斯将电脑装进了大家的口袋里
Steve Jobs put a computer in everyone's pocket.

88
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,860
卢克差点死于在电动扶梯上脱帽衫
Luke almost died taking off a hoodie on an escalator.

89
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:03,760
我要表达的重点是 梦想是需要培育的
My point is, dreams need to be fostered.

90
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:05,000
说老实话
And if I'm being honest,

91
00:03:05,380 --> 00:03:08,140
我还挺乐意担任那两个年轻人的导师的
I kind of love the idea of being a mentor to these two young minds.

92
00:03:09,980 --> 00:03:10,680
木勺子
Wooden spoon!

93
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,480
快用木勺子隔断连接
Knock it away with a wooden spoon!

94
00:03:13,220 --> 00:03:14,000
谢谢救命之恩
Thank you.

95
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:18,920
这简直太棒了
Oh, this is amazing!

96
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:20,080
天啊
Oh, my God.

97
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,880
大爸的走路姿势就是那样的
Daddy so walks like that!

98
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:23,860
你们为什么笑成这样
Why are you guys laughing?

99
00:03:24,487 --> 00:03:26,220
因为 因为我们开心
We -- We were happy?

100
00:03:26,220 --> 00:03:26,840
从什么时候开始的
Since when?

101
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:28,820
你们又在看那个视频吗
Were you watching that video again?

102
00:03:29,180 --> 00:03:31,079
最近 高中学校的海豚吉祥物
Recently, the high school dolphin mascot

103
00:03:31,079 --> 00:03:33,920
在橄榄球比赛期间 一直在模仿小卡的动作
has been, uh, mocking Cam during football games.

104
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:35,900
他简直是个... 我一般很少用这个词夸人
He's -- and I don't use this word lightly --

105
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:37,000
天才
a genius.

106
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,800
在比赛中用用脑子不行吗
How about we get our heads in the game?!

107
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:46,401
瑞克 你要从中间飞奔过去
Rick, you're gonna be streaking through.

108
00:03:46,401 --> 00:03:48,794
所以要撞开别人飞快地穿过去 明白吗
So it's gonna be boom, boom. You got it?

109
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:51,960
我很惊讶你竟然无法
I'm surprised you can't see the humor

110
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,420
从那个吉祥物的行为中感受到幽默
in what the mascot is doing.

111
00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:55,260
这跟扮小丑很像不是吗
Isn't it a lot like clowning?

112
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,117
-你刚说什么 -你是疯了吗
- What did you just say? - Are you insane?

113
00:03:57,117 --> 00:03:59,560
扮吉祥物跟小丑表演完全不一样
Mascot-ing is nothing like clowning!

114
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:01,640
小丑是宫廷小丑的后代
Clowns are descendants of the court jester,

115
00:04:02,060 --> 00:04:03,440
是国王的忠实谏臣
truth-teller to the king.

116
00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:05,980
吉祥物根本不懂什么真善美
Mascots know nothing of veritas and beauty.

117
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:08,120
你们不就是折气球做小狗吗
Don't you just make wiener dogs out of balloons?

118
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,680
你这是嫉妒 因为没有小孩子会说
You are just jealous because no kid ever said,

119
00:04:10,820 --> 00:04:12,360
"妈妈 今年我的生日能请一位
"Hey, Mom, this year for my birthday,

120
00:04:12,420 --> 00:04:13,568
缉毒警察来吗"
can we get a narc?"

121
00:04:13,568 --> 00:04:15,200
好吧 我很抱歉
Okay, look, I'm -- I'm sorry.

122
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:17,320
我压力山大 这个吉祥物让我很不爽
I'm just stressed out. This mascot is under my skin!

123
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:20,480
今天我不能让他害我出丑
I can't have him making me look like a fool today.

124
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,680
我刚得知一位
I just found out a recruiter

125
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,420
北中央密苏里大学的猎头
from the University of North Central Missouri

126
00:04:23,420 --> 00:04:25,140
要来看我执教
is coming to watch me coach.

127
00:04:25,220 --> 00:04:25,920
猎头
A recruiter?

128
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,960
你申请了密苏里州的工作吗
Did you apply for a job in Missouri?

129
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:29,357
我只说了我有空
I just said I was available.

130
00:04:29,357 --> 00:04:31,180
都没跟我商量商量
W-Without consulting me?

131
00:04:31,180 --> 00:04:32,420
你不是一直说可以接受
Well, you always said you were okay

132
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:34,120
全家搬回密苏里吗
with moving back to Missouri at some point,

133
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:36,380
把我们的小家乐变成农家乐
turning our little family into a "farmily."

134
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:37,240
你知道我很讨厌那个词
You know I hate that word.

135
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:38,560
为什么 意思清楚还很有趣啊
Why? It's descriptive and fun.

136
00:04:38,580 --> 00:04:40,160
而且你知道吗 如果我得到这份工作
And you know what? Look, if I got this job,

137
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:43,360
我就会是历史上第一个公开出柜的
I would be the first openly gay college football coach

138
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:43,860
大学橄榄球教练
in history,

139
00:04:43,860 --> 00:04:46,680
我以为你会支持的
and I would think you'd support that.

140
00:04:46,860 --> 00:04:48,940
我也以为你会先问过我之后
And I would think that you would ask me

141
00:04:48,940 --> 00:04:50,980
才举家搬迁搞农家乐
before uprooting our whole farmily --

142
00:04:52,180 --> 00:04:53,460
该死 我被洗脑了
Damn it, it's in there now!

143
00:04:58,564 --> 00:05:00,830
你们好呀 小可爱们
Hello, mis ninos.

144
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:03,220
谢谢你帮我们照看几小时宝宝
Thank you so much for watching the babies for a few hours.

145
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:05,180
如果你分不清谁是谁
If you have trouble telling them apart,

146
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,320
就脱掉他们的纸尿裤
just take off their diapers.

147
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:07,960
我在乔治的纸尿裤里面写了他的名字
I wrote George's name inside his.

148
00:05:08,060 --> 00:05:09,580
我的曾孙们来了
There's my great-grandchildren.

149
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:10,977
他们能认人了吗
Do they recognize faces?

150
00:05:10,977 --> 00:05:12,480
我需要给他们塞点钱
Do I need to start slipping them cash

151
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,660
好让他们知道谁才是老大吗
to let them know who's in charge?

152
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:16,160
外公 你不用花钱贿赂他们
Grandpa, you don't need to buy their love.

153
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:17,820
给我吧 我会把你夸上天
Buy mine, and I'll talk you up.

154
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:20,240
我们要照顾宝宝吗 我要不要取消高尔夫球
Are we babysitting? Should I cancel golf?

155
00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:21,980
不不不 我知道让你跟你的朋友
No, no, no, no, I know how important it is

156
00:05:21,980 --> 00:05:23,560
一起抱怨现在的年轻人
for you and your friends to complain about

157
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:25,520
跟你们那一代人
how young people today

158
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:27,540
不太一样是多么重要
are slightly different than your generation.

159
00:05:27,820 --> 00:05:29,940
范·迪塞尔就是嘴里不含棒棒糖
Vin Diesel is just Telly Savalas

160
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:32,680
没什么名言的泰利·萨拉瓦斯而已
without the lollipop and a great catchphrase.

161
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:36,340
好了 你俩 我知道新手爸妈的二人时光
Okay, and you two, I know how precious alone time is

162
00:05:36,340 --> 00:05:37,580
有多宝贵
for new parents,

163
00:05:37,580 --> 00:05:39,220
-所以你们都走吧 -拜拜
- so everybody go. - Bye-bye!

164
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:41,260
下午玩得开心哦
Have a great afternoon!

165
00:05:41,649 --> 00:05:43,980
好了 小可爱们 歌洛莉亚为你们
Okay, mis niños, Gloria has planned

166
00:05:43,980 --> 00:05:46,900
安排好了一个刺激的下午
a very exciting afternoon for you.

167
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,580
你们看
Let's see.

168
00:05:48,580 --> 00:05:52,600
准备好拒绝撒旦
Who is ready to reject Satan

169
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:55,460
和他的空头支票了吗
and all his empty promises?

170
00:05:56,020 --> 00:05:59,360
今天 我要偷偷地给宝宝们施洗礼
Today, I'm having the babies secretly baptized,

171
00:05:59,740 --> 00:06:02,620
让他们成为天主教徒 和加入我们这个成员间
both into Catholicism and into the crazy things

172
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:04,200
互相恶搞的疯狂家庭
we do to each other in this family.

173
00:06:05,173 --> 00:06:09,579
-绝对不行 -讲点道理 扎西
- Absolutely not! - Okay, be reasonable, Tashi.

174
00:06:09,579 --> 00:06:11,513
