Ew, my dad liked that. Euch.

350
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:06,260
好吧 莉莉 我要去看比赛了
All right, Lily, I'm on my way to the game.

351
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,080
情况很糟吗
How bad is it?

352
00:12:07,140 --> 00:12:09,080
大爸快被海豚虐死了
The dolphin is eviscerating Dad.

353
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:15,380
如果是我被虐 他肯定会想办法
Oh, if it was me, he would totally do something.

354
00:12:15,460 --> 00:12:17,440
可我该怎么做 给我个提示[标牌]
But what?! Ah, just give me a sign!

355
00:12:21,180 --> 00:12:23,340
老天爷 有没有花点钱就能解决的办法
Is there any way I could just throw money at it?

356
00:12:40,227 --> 00:12:41,980
除了拉米雷斯神父
Except for Father Ramirez,

357
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:43,200
我问的每位牧师
all the priests I asked

358
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:46,580
都觉得秘密受洗"不太妥当"
were "Uncomfortable" with my secret baptism.

359
00:12:46,980 --> 00:12:50,140
说这事"基本和绑架一样"
They said it was "borderline kidnapping,"

360
00:12:50,380 --> 00:12:53,040
还说我的小诡计"像魔鬼一样"
that they found my trickery "devilish."

361
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:57,560
天主教什么时候这么爱评判人了
It's like, when did Catholics become so judgmental?

362
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,380
杰 你回来了
Jay, you're back!

363
00:13:31,900 --> 00:13:33,019
你为什么听起来这么诧异
Why do you sound surprised?

364
00:13:33,019 --> 00:13:34,609
像没指望我能活着回来似的
You cut my brakes or something?

365
00:13:35,929 --> 00:13:37,439
家里为什么有个牧师
What the hell's a priest doing here?

366
00:13:37,479 --> 00:13:39,420
不过是来检查一下
Oh, it's just a check-up.

367
00:13:39,660 --> 00:13:42,660
宝宝之一或许被附身了
One of the babies maybe is...possessed.

368
00:13:42,980 --> 00:13:45,020
等等 你要瞒着海莉和那个谁
Wait, are you baptizing them behind Haley

369
00:13:45,020 --> 00:13:46,060
让宝宝们受洗
and what's-his-name's back?

370
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:48,280
你不能对别人的孩子这样做
You can't do that to other people's kids!

371
00:13:48,380 --> 00:13:49,600
没什么大不了的
It's not a big deal.

372
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:51,490
有用的话 宝宝们会受到保护
If it works, the babies are protected,

373
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:53,120
她们的灵魂就安全了
their souls are safe,

374
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:55,220
可以在天堂直到永远
and they're gonna spend eternity in Heaven.

375
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,080
如果没用
If it doesn't,

376
00:13:56,140 --> 00:13:58,100
就像洗了个澡一样
it's just like I gave them a little bath.

377
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:04,400
"老"字我听得懂
"Viejo." I know that word.

378
00:14:05,140 --> 00:14:07,020
这位时间老人居然说我老
Did Father Time here just call me old?

379
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,780
好了 我们冷静点
Okay, let's all calm down.

380
00:14:08,980 --> 00:14:11,400
让宝宝们投入唯一的真神的怀抱
Let's introduce the babies to the one true God,

381
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:13,297
然后一起吃些咖啡蛋糕
then we'll have some coffee cake.

382
00:14:13,297 --> 00:14:14,960
你知道你这么做过分了
You know you're crossing a line here.

383
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:17,220
不用让海莉和迪兰知道
Haley and Dylan doesn't even have to know.

384
00:14:17,620 --> 00:14:18,480
知道什么
Know what?

385
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:20,600
家里为什么有个牧师
Why is there a priest here?

386
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:22,820
我跟你说过 茵素被附身了
I told you, Poppy's possessed!

387
00:14:23,060 --> 00:14:24,900
除了你别人都看出来了
Everybody can see it but you.

388
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,520
你就问问我们不行吗
Why didn't you just ask us?

389
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:33,460
我问过 我问过你
I did. I did ask you.

390
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:35,320
你答应了 我想你当时喝得很醉
You said yes. I think you were very drunk.

391
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:37,460
海莉 新菲尔
Haley, New-Phil,

392
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:39,200
你们真的想让孩子受洗吗
do you really want this baptism?

393
00:14:39,660 --> 00:14:40,520
我不知道
I don't know.

394
00:14:40,660 --> 00:14:42,560
我们没怎么想过这个问题
We've barely thought about it.

395
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:45,360
迪兰确实说过会研究一下宗教的事
Dylan did say that he was going to research some religions.

396
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:47,700
吉姆·琼斯纪录片我刚看了一半
I'm halfway through this Jim Jones documentary.

397
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:50,054
目前觉得那个宗教挺酷的[是个邪教]
So far, that religion seems pretty cool.

398
00:14:50,054 --> 00:14:52,560
很抱歉我没事先问你
I'm sorry that I didn't ask you before.

399
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:55,369
我真的想让乔治和茵素受洗
I really wanted to do this for George and Poppy.

400
00:14:55,369 --> 00:14:58,380
受洗会让他们的灵魂
Baptism is gonna allow their souls

401
00:14:58,380 --> 00:14:59,840
找到永恒的平和
to find eternal peace.

402
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:00,960
有什么代价
What's the catch?

403
00:15:01,180 --> 00:15:03,040
总是要捐款
Well, there's a lot of donations

404
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:04,560
还要为性爱感到羞耻
and some shame around sex,

405
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:05,780
但圣诞节很热闹
but Christmas is fun.

406
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:08,420
我都不知道该怎么决定
I don't even know how I can decide,

407
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:10,540
但我想没什么大问题
but I guess it can't hurt.

408
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:13,920
你们能去天国了
You're going to the kingdom of Heaven.

409
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:18,236
在那 你们会与人类最优秀的灵魂相遇
And there, you're going to join the souls of some of our greats,

410
00:15:18,236 --> 00:15:21,260
例如圣女贞德 特蕾莎修女
like Joan of Arc, Mother Theresa,

411
00:15:21,260 --> 00:15:22,880
丹尼·德维托也早晚会死
Danny DeVito when he dies.

412
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:23,740
开始吧
Go.

413
00:15:24,860 --> 00:15:25,240
好的
Yes.

414
00:15:29,501 --> 00:15:32,200
-等等 等等 等等 -又怎么了
- Wait. Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait. - What now?

415
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,177
不好意思
Well, I'm sorry.

416
00:15:33,177 --> 00:15:35,180
只是 这突然间变得好真实
It just -- It suddenly just got very real,

417
00:15:35,180 --> 00:15:36,881
让他做完就是感觉不对
and it does not feel right to end,

418
00:15:36,881 --> 00:15:38,171
我不知道为什么
and I don't know why,

419
00:15:38,171 --> 00:15:40,200
外公 是我反应过度了吗
Grandpa, am I making too much of this? I --

420
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:42,760
别问他 因为他根本不信上帝
Don't ask him because he doesn't even believe in God.

421
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:43,800
我只是不觉得
I just don't think

422
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:46,100
人需要教堂和袍子那些东西
you need church, costumes, all that stuff

423
00:15:46,100 --> 00:15:47,800
来感受神圣的力量
to feel a higher power.

424
00:15:48,300 --> 00:15:49,760
但你相信它的存在
But you think there is one?

425
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,619
是的 我在孩子们出生时感受到了
Yeah, I felt it when my kids were born,

426
00:15:51,619 --> 00:15:53,860
当我遇到这个想共度一生的疯女人
and, um, when I met this crazy woman here

427
00:15:53,860 --> 00:15:55,380
我也感受到了
that I want to spend the rest of my life with,

428
00:15:55,380 --> 00:15:58,140
但也可以是日常小事
but, you know, it can be just a normal everyday thing, too.

429
00:15:58,140 --> 00:15:59,620
好比我听到棒球飞进手套时
You know, like the way it makes me feel

430
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:01,920
所体验的那种感觉
when I hear a baseball thump into a mitt

431
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:04,100
或是汤姆·威兹的声音
or the way Tom Waits' voice

432
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:07,120
莫名地难听又好听
can somehow be ugly and beautiful at the same time.

433
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,060
你明白我的意思吗
Am I making any sense?

434
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:12,280
去年 迪兰和我去了优胜美地国家公园
You know, last year, Dylan and I went to Yosemite,

435
00:16:12,780 --> 00:16:14,600
某个清晨我们很早就醒了
and we woke up really early one morning,

436
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:17,720
我们静静望着那些峻美的群山
and it was just us and those gorgeous mountains,

437
00:16:17,900 --> 00:16:20,800
那么多参天大树 大鹿带着小鹿
a bunch of huge trees, and a family of deer.

438
00:16:21,980 --> 00:16:23,340
是那么美好
It was so beautiful,

439
00:16:23,340 --> 00:16:26,220
让我觉得我和某种更伟大的能量
and it made me feel like I was connected

440
00:16:26,220 --> 00:16:28,200
联系在了一起
to something bigger than myself.

441
00:16:28,536 --> 00:16:29,676
或许某天
You know what, maybe one day

442
00:16:29,676 --> 00:16:31,600
我们会让他们在教堂受洗
we can get them baptized in a church,

443
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:33,140
但现在
but for now,

444
00:16:33,140 --> 00:16:34,920
我们何不带他们去优胜美地国家公园
why don't we take them up to Yosemite

445
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:38,360
然后仰望天空说谢谢
and look up and say thank you?

446
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:42,100
听上去是个很棒的计划 海莉
That sounds like a great plan, Haley.

447
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:42,780
是啊
Yeah.

448
00:16:42,780 --> 00:16:45,580
你在那里的时候可以烤些棉花糖
And maybe roast some marshmallows while you're there

449
00:16:45,580 --> 00:16:47,600
这样他们就会习惯接近火[地狱]了
so that they get used to being around fire.

450
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:50,620
不 尼克 你不能一直从市场部拿钱
No, Nick, you can't keep taking money from marketing.

451
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:52,100
他们需要
They need --

452
00:16:52,246 --> 00:16:52,732
什么
What?

453
00:16:52,780 --> 00:16:54,660
你在度假的时候
No, I will not stay on the phone

454
00:16:54,660 --> 00:16:56,200
我不会和你一直保持联系
while you moon a cruise ship.

455
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:57,180
你是
Are you --

456
00:16:57,180 --> 00:16:58,200
-克莱尔 -等等
- Claire? - Hang on.

457
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:58,760
克莱尔
Claire.

458
00:16:58,860 --> 00:16:59,900
那是什么
What was that out there?

459
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:01,759
我以为我们是一队的
I thought we were supposed to be on the same team.

460
00:17:01,759 --> 00:17:03,248
我们是啊
We are. I --

461
00:17:03,340 --> 00:17:04,560
他们有个好主意
They've got a great idea.

462
00:17:04,620 --> 00:17:06,500
你只是嫉妒因为卢克去了斯库特那里
You're just jealous because Luke went to Scooter

463
00:17:06,500 --> 00:17:07,200
而不是来找你
and not to you.

464
00:17:07,300 --> 00:17:08,680
才不是
That is not true.

465
00:17:08,779 --> 00:17:10,482
真的吗 你不觉得他们有点东西吗
Really? You don't think they're on to something?

466
00:17:10,591 --> 00:17:11,920
是个很棒的想法 好吧
It's an amazing idea. Okay.

467
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:14,340
但他为什么不来找我
But why didn't he come to me?

468
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:16,960
因为你爱我所做的一切
Because you love everything I do.

469
00:17:17,020 --> 00:17:19,380
我想确定这真的是个好主意
I wanted to make sure this was actually a good idea.

470
00:17:19,620 --> 00:17:20,600
这个想法太机智了
That is so smart.

471
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:22,537
怎么会有人这么帅又...
How is someone this handsome --

472
00:17:22,537 --> 00:17:25,096
我想说的是
Okay, this is what I'm talking about.

473
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:28,400
我喜欢和你一起发明 但这是生意
I love inventing with you, but this is a business.

474
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:30,540
斯库特有很多经验
And Scooter has a lot of experience.

475
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:31,949
这并不代表
That doesn't take away from

476
00:17:31,949 --> 00:17:33,658
我们共同创造的一切就不重要
all of the things that we've made together.

477
00:17:33,658 --> 00:17:35,512
是它们带领我走到了现在
All of that stuff brought me here.

478
00:17:35,512 --> 00:17:38,480
-真的吗 -表格填写器的拼写少不了Phil[菲尔]
- Really? - You can't spell FormFiller without Phil.

479
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:40,000
但你知道是可以的吧
But you know you can, right?

480
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,840
他很伤心 我是在安慰他
The man's hurting. I'm throwing him a bone.

481
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:43,080
真为你骄傲 卢克
I'm proud of you, Luke.

482
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,660
见鬼 我也为斯库特骄傲
Damn it, I'm proud of Scooter, too.

483
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:47,420
哇
Wow.

484
00:17:47,514 --> 00:17:50,102
看到你们报告想法时
You know, seeing your guys' pitch,

485
00:17:50,102 --> 00:17:54,412
眼中闪耀的狂热还有热情
and the -- the passion, that sparkle in your eye,

486
00:17:54,412 --> 00:17:57,740
我都不记得上次见你
I -- I don't remember the last time

487
00:17:57,740 --> 00:17:59,460
这么在乎一件事是什么时候了
I saw you care about anything that much.

488
00:18:00,980 --> 00:18:02,780
我也不记得我上次是什么时候
I don't remember the last time I did.

489
00:18:02,860 --> 00:18:03,920
这真是太伤人了
That's super hurtful.

490
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:06,080
没有 亲爱的 我指的是工作
No, sweetie, I'm talking about work.

491
00:18:06,860 --> 00:18:08,820
说实话 我以前早上起床的时候
I -- Honestly, I used to get up in the morning,

492
00:18:08,820 --> 00:18:11,100
我迫不及待地要上班
and I couldn't wait to get to the office.

493
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:13,050
现在我感到害怕
And now I dread it.

494
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:14,340
没错
I do.

495
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:18,760
我怀念热爱工作或者喜欢工作的日子
I miss loving my job or even liking it.

496
00:18:19,340 --> 00:18:22,900
现在我做的就是为别人擦屁股 处理投诉
Now all I do is put out fires and manage complaints

497
00:18:22,900 --> 00:18:25,300
还因为一些无关紧要的
and -- and lose sleep over stuff

498
00:18:25,300 --> 00:18:27,580
事情而失眠
that really doesn't matter.

499
00:18:29,358 --> 00:18:31,054
是啊 我想我
Yeah. I think I'm --

500
00:18:31,220 --> 00:18:33,560
我想我要辞职了
I think I'm gonna quit my job.

501
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:35,400
你说真的吗
Are you serious?

502
00:18:36,100 --> 00:18:36,760
是的
Yeah.

503
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:38,900
这疯狂吗
Is that -- Is that crazy?

504
00:18:39,520 --> 00:18:42,540
没有 倒不是
Uh, no. No, not necessarily.

505
00:18:42,740 --> 00:18:44,260
我的意思是 疯狂是坚持
I mean, crazy is sticking with something

506
00:18:44,260 --> 00:18:46,100
做一件让你痛苦几个月的事情
that's been making you miserable for months

507
00:18:46,100 --> 00:18:48,200
而现在有很多公司
when there are so many companies out there

508
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:50,084
都想要你这样的人才
who would want someone with your skills.

509
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:52,140
尼克 你还在吗
Hey, Nick, you still there?

510
00:18:52,340 --> 00:18:55,140
我今天早上告诉我儿子 他不应该放弃
I told my son this morning that he should never quit.

511
00:18:55,360 --> 00:18:56,400
我错了
Well, I was wrong.

512
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:57,920
我退出
I'm out.

513
00:19:01,181 --> 00:19:02,998
天哪 感觉太好了
Aah! That felt so good!

514
00:19:03,060 --> 00:19:05,020
太可怕了 但感觉太好了
It was so scary, but it was so good.

515
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:07,200
我也真为你骄傲
I'm so proud of you, too!

516
00:19:07,900 --> 00:19:08,920
听着
Hear, hear!

517
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:10,540
致我们下一场冒险
To our next adventure!

518
00:19:10,732 --> 00:19:13,672
我在酒窖里找到的
Oh, I found this in the wine cellar.

519
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:15,100
那是个地下室 玛格丽特
It's a basement, Margaret.

520
00:19:15,418 --> 00:19:16,920
快 快 超过他
No, no, close the gap!

521
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:18,000
球 球 球 球 球
Ball, ball, ball, ball, ball!

522
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:22,620
简直是场噩梦
It was a nightmare.

523
00:19:22,900 --> 00:19:24,940
这是我职业生涯中最大的机会
The biggest opportunity of my career,

524
00:19:24,940 --> 00:19:26,340
而我无法集中
and I couldn't focus.

525
00:19:26,540 --> 00:19:28,880
我尽量不做出任何可笑的动作
I tried not to make any mockable movements.

526
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:32,400
大卫·达西的水平太高了
David Tashi was just operating at too high a level.

527
00:19:32,960 --> 00:19:35,400
但后来奇妙的事情发生了
But then something wonderful happened.

528
00:19:40,331 --> 00:19:41,625
天哪 你打我
Oh. You hurt me.

529
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:44,980
就在那时 我意识到我认识那只鸡
That's when I realized I knew that chicken --

530
00:19:45,320 --> 00:19:46,260
那弱弱的拳头
those weak punches,

531
00:19:46,600 --> 00:19:48,760
体育课时脸上写着"最后再来选我"的小跑
